WEBVTT

01:30.330 --> 01:35.009
[The Heir]

01:35.440 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 36]

01:39.229 --> 01:40.039
Ronghua,

01:40.680 --> 01:42.280
you've finally come around.

01:43.280 --> 01:46.200
Although you won't be the legitimate wife,

01:46.759 --> 01:49.280
the dowry we prepared for you

01:49.280 --> 01:50.430
lacks nothing.

01:50.950 --> 01:53.759
When you take these with you
into your new household,

01:53.759 --> 01:55.200
people will envy you.

01:57.430 --> 01:58.690
You are right, Mother.

01:59.000 --> 02:01.070
I was ignorant before

02:01.230 --> 02:02.400
and lost my temper.

02:02.920 --> 02:04.950
Today, I just want

02:04.950 --> 02:06.870
to take a good look
at the dowry with you,

02:06.870 --> 02:10.199
so as not to waste all the care
you and Benchang put into this.

02:12.630 --> 02:14.430
Let's go. Let me show you.

02:17.079 --> 02:18.360
Come in, Ronghua.

02:22.840 --> 02:23.640
Look at these.

02:24.560 --> 02:26.090
These are all your dowries.

02:28.190 --> 02:29.240
Silks and satins.

02:34.470 --> 02:35.400
Wedding quilts.

02:36.000 --> 02:36.840
And here is...

02:40.400 --> 02:41.430
jewelries.

02:42.350 --> 02:43.550
Everything you need.

02:51.560 --> 02:53.220
Nanjing is far away from home.

02:54.000 --> 02:55.430
So your father, brothers, and I

02:55.430 --> 02:57.280
cannot take care of you all the time.

02:57.280 --> 03:01.710
So all we can do is make sure
your dowry wants for nothing.

03:02.840 --> 03:04.680
We won't let you suffer a single slight

03:04.680 --> 03:06.080
in your husband's house.

03:06.080 --> 03:06.840
Mother,

03:07.520 --> 03:08.630
you've been most thoughtful,

03:08.630 --> 03:10.830
arranging all these fine things for me.

03:12.430 --> 03:15.030
But as the saying goes,
old clothes are better.

03:15.650 --> 03:18.680
Can I take all my old clothes

03:18.800 --> 03:20.030
with me?

03:20.910 --> 03:22.750
Those are all old clothes.

03:23.280 --> 03:24.810
Why do you want to take them?

03:28.360 --> 03:30.120
Because many of them

03:31.000 --> 03:32.630
were made by you.

03:33.800 --> 03:35.079
I want to keep them

03:35.710 --> 03:37.370
to keep a piece of home with me.

03:45.680 --> 03:47.030
Thank you, Ronghua,

03:48.000 --> 03:49.600
for keeping me in your heart.

03:50.910 --> 03:51.590
Okay.

03:52.250 --> 03:53.850
I'll go prepare them for you.

03:54.800 --> 03:56.260
You can take another look.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.080
Mother.

04:16.160 --> 04:17.160
Where did you go?

04:18.040 --> 04:18.680
Well,

04:19.390 --> 04:20.560
Ronghua came around

04:20.870 --> 04:22.630
and wanted to see the dowry.

04:22.750 --> 04:25.920
So I took her
to the warehouse to have a look.

04:26.480 --> 04:27.880
She was quite satisfied.

04:28.800 --> 04:29.390
Well,

04:29.390 --> 04:31.830
I'll go help her pack some other things.

05:14.680 --> 05:16.210
Benchang, why are you here?

05:18.510 --> 05:19.360
Nothing.

05:20.510 --> 05:22.510
Mother said you were here
looking over the dowry,

05:22.510 --> 05:23.910
so I came by to take a look.

05:24.510 --> 05:26.360
If there is anything missing,

05:27.730 --> 05:29.160
I can get it for you in time.

05:29.160 --> 05:30.290
Nothing is missing.

05:31.190 --> 05:32.240
After all,

05:32.750 --> 05:34.310
I belong to the Tian family.

05:35.510 --> 05:37.070
I will do the thing I ought

05:38.040 --> 05:39.440
to do for the Tian family.

05:54.510 --> 05:55.950
After trying on many clothes,

05:55.950 --> 05:56.830
I'm tired.

05:57.070 --> 05:59.010
I want to go to the tearoom for a rest.

05:59.010 --> 06:00.570
My Lady, Madam said

06:00.600 --> 06:02.190
you should go back after trying them on.

06:02.190 --> 06:03.120
Enough.

06:03.390 --> 06:04.540
Do I need your permission

06:04.540 --> 06:05.780
to have a cup of tea?

06:06.950 --> 06:08.000
Just wait here,

06:08.110 --> 06:09.240
and don't follow me.

06:16.430 --> 06:17.240
Zhen.

06:17.430 --> 06:18.830
You were right.

06:18.920 --> 06:21.320
The contraband ink
was hidden in the dowry.

06:21.600 --> 06:22.870
Did you see it clearly?

06:23.000 --> 06:24.000
How much is there?

06:26.160 --> 06:28.420
If there are dozens of sticks in each box,

06:29.190 --> 06:31.680
that would be
over a thousand sticks in total.

06:31.680 --> 06:33.010
Over a thousand sticks?

06:35.480 --> 06:37.190
This is a capital offense.

06:37.680 --> 06:39.390
Tian Benchang wants
to be an official so badly

06:39.390 --> 06:41.320
that he is willing to risk his life.

06:41.430 --> 06:42.159
Zhen.

06:42.870 --> 06:43.830
At this point,

06:43.920 --> 06:45.580
I have nothing to be afraid of.

06:45.850 --> 06:47.680
Why don't we go straight
to the prefectural office

06:47.680 --> 06:49.360
and report this to Prefect He?

06:49.390 --> 06:50.190
No.

06:50.310 --> 06:51.600
The prefectural office

06:51.600 --> 06:53.460
is full of Tian Benchang's spies.

06:53.830 --> 06:55.190
If we report it rashly,

06:55.470 --> 06:57.210
before we even see Prefect He,

06:57.310 --> 06:59.070
Tian Benchang will get the news

06:59.180 --> 07:00.780
and move the contraband ink.

07:01.750 --> 07:03.480
If we want to catch him,

07:03.830 --> 07:05.490
we must catch him red-handed.

07:06.780 --> 07:08.510
But he's always cautious.

07:08.920 --> 07:11.090
How can we hide it from him?

07:13.950 --> 07:14.680
Ronghua.

07:15.560 --> 07:17.240
When you get married tomorrow,

07:17.240 --> 07:20.190
Tian Benchang will definitely escort you
out of the city, right?

07:20.190 --> 07:21.160
Of course.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.450
You and I have similar figures.

07:24.720 --> 07:27.600
I will take your place
in the bridal sedan chair tomorrow.

07:27.600 --> 07:29.270
Zhen, it's too dangerous.

07:29.270 --> 07:30.480
I can't let you take this risk.

07:30.480 --> 07:32.740
Ronghua, I'm not only doing this for you,

07:33.159 --> 07:35.220
but also for myself and the Li family.

07:37.000 --> 07:38.040
Tomorrow,

07:38.510 --> 07:40.800
when the bridal sedan
arrives at Sibao Street,

07:40.800 --> 07:42.190
I will stop it.

07:42.440 --> 07:44.350
Xiao Qi and Doggie will help me

07:44.740 --> 07:46.640
lay the contraband ink
hidden in the dowry

07:46.640 --> 07:47.640
before everyone.

07:47.670 --> 07:49.330
When we catch him red-handed,

07:49.360 --> 07:51.270
no matter how cunning Tian Benchang is,

07:51.270 --> 07:52.730
he won't be able to deny it.

07:54.159 --> 07:55.870
As for your marriage,

07:56.240 --> 07:58.870
it will naturally be invalid
since it involves Tian Benchang's

07:58.870 --> 08:00.870
illicit foreign trade and bribery.

08:01.320 --> 08:03.120
Ronghua, this time,

08:04.310 --> 08:05.510
you must listen to me.

08:12.310 --> 08:13.750
Ronghua, let's go separately.

08:13.750 --> 08:14.890
I will take the back door.

08:14.890 --> 08:15.890
Go home quickly,

08:15.910 --> 08:17.570
so as not to arouse suspicion.

08:18.000 --> 08:18.750
Go quickly.

08:34.600 --> 08:36.480
Ungrateful traitor!

08:37.549 --> 08:38.360
Benchang.

08:38.909 --> 08:40.030
Since it has come to this,

08:40.030 --> 08:41.720
are we still going
to move the ink tomorrow?

08:41.720 --> 08:42.630
Nonsense.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.790
If the ink doesn't
leave the city tomorrow,

08:44.790 --> 08:46.520
we'll miss the river shipment.

08:46.720 --> 08:48.600
If we delay the delivery,

08:48.960 --> 08:51.020
we won't be able to get the money back.

08:53.630 --> 08:55.360
Since Li Zhen wants to stage
a bride-swap trap

08:55.360 --> 08:56.720
to catch me red-handed.

08:57.320 --> 08:58.000
Well.

08:59.600 --> 09:01.080
I'll let her know

09:01.910 --> 09:04.000
what it means to be too clever

09:04.720 --> 09:06.320
and dig her own grave.

09:07.930 --> 09:16.500
[Changsheng Garden]

09:18.870 --> 09:21.000
You guys go over there. Come on.

09:24.270 --> 09:25.330
This way. This way.

09:28.480 --> 09:29.480
What time is it?

09:30.000 --> 09:31.930
It is already past the Hour of Chen.

09:34.630 --> 09:37.870
Go check on my parents and Benchang

09:38.380 --> 09:39.780
and see if they are ready.

09:40.180 --> 09:40.700
Yes.

10:07.720 --> 10:08.360
Ronghua.

10:08.720 --> 10:09.510
Ronghua.

10:10.840 --> 10:11.670
It's me.

10:14.870 --> 10:16.750
Zhen, I was worried about you.

10:16.750 --> 10:17.440
I was wondering

10:17.440 --> 10:19.030
why you hadn't come yet.

10:19.240 --> 10:20.340
Ronghua, don't worry.

10:20.340 --> 10:21.640
We'll proceed as planned.

10:21.640 --> 10:22.370
Don't worry.

10:22.670 --> 10:24.440
Keep a close watch on this courtyard.

10:24.440 --> 10:25.630
Don't let anyone in or out.

10:25.630 --> 10:27.080
Zhen, go hide.

10:27.080 --> 10:28.950
Hide behind the screen. Go quickly.

10:28.950 --> 10:29.560
Okay.

10:42.030 --> 10:43.560
Benchang, why are you here?

10:43.630 --> 10:44.480
Search.

10:45.790 --> 10:46.720
How dare you!

10:48.840 --> 10:50.790
Tian Benchang, what are you doing?

10:51.910 --> 10:53.080
Let me go!

10:53.550 --> 10:54.390
Let go!

10:54.840 --> 10:55.550
-Zhen!
-Ronghua!

10:55.550 --> 10:57.600
Let her go! Let her go!

10:57.630 --> 10:58.670
-Zhen.
-Let go!

10:58.670 --> 11:01.270
You and Ronghua's friendship
is moving indeed.

11:01.270 --> 11:02.000
What a pity.

11:02.440 --> 11:03.670
You miscalculated.

11:03.670 --> 11:05.470
You're no match for me after all.

11:06.150 --> 11:07.960
Tian Benchang, I know all
about your trading your own sister

11:07.960 --> 11:09.600
for power and profiting
from illicit foreign trade.

11:09.600 --> 11:11.080
Don't make any more mistakes.

11:11.080 --> 11:12.840
Drag her out.
Get her in the bridal sedan chair.

11:12.840 --> 11:13.320
Don't touch me!

11:13.320 --> 11:13.840
Ronghua!

11:13.840 --> 11:14.480
Ronghua!

11:14.630 --> 11:15.320
Zhen.

11:15.550 --> 11:16.150
Zhen!

11:16.150 --> 11:16.720
Ronghua!

11:16.720 --> 11:17.390
Zhen!

11:17.390 --> 11:17.960
Ronghua!

11:17.960 --> 11:18.720
Let me go!

11:18.720 --> 11:20.480
Let me go! Zhen!

11:20.510 --> 11:22.200
Let me go! Let me go!

11:22.550 --> 11:23.360
Let me go!

11:25.170 --> 11:26.050
Let me go!

11:26.080 --> 11:27.000
Tian Benchang!

11:27.120 --> 11:28.570
You're trading your own sister
for glory and riches.

11:28.570 --> 11:29.630
You are shameless!

11:29.630 --> 11:30.390
Zhen.

11:30.920 --> 11:33.080
Once I've sent Ronghua
into the bridal sedan chair,

11:33.080 --> 11:34.880
I'll come back and deal with you.

11:35.870 --> 11:36.910
Tie her up.

11:36.910 --> 11:37.440
Yes!

11:37.960 --> 11:39.630
Let me go!

11:40.720 --> 11:41.630
Let go!

11:42.360 --> 11:43.270
Let go!

11:48.270 --> 11:49.000
Ronghua!

11:49.480 --> 11:51.680
If you really care about Zhen's safety,

11:51.790 --> 11:53.480
just behave and get married.

11:54.480 --> 11:57.210
Otherwise,
you'll be the one to drive her to ruin.

12:00.120 --> 12:01.720
Keep a close watch on Ronghua.

12:01.720 --> 12:02.240
Yes.

12:04.250 --> 12:06.390
Has everything been arranged
with Officer Zhang?

12:06.390 --> 12:07.650
It's all taken care of.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.290
Benchang, don't worry.

12:09.510 --> 12:12.600
I will make sure Ronghua
leaves the city safely.

12:15.910 --> 12:17.320
Go out and guard the courtyard.

12:17.320 --> 12:18.120
Without my order,

12:18.120 --> 12:19.550
don't let anyone in.

12:19.790 --> 12:20.510
Yes.

12:52.790 --> 12:53.870
Tian Benchang.

12:54.300 --> 12:56.030
You illegally imprison a civilian.

12:56.030 --> 12:57.720
Aren't you afraid someone
will report you to the prefectural office

12:57.720 --> 12:59.600
and bring troops to arrest you?

12:59.860 --> 13:02.060
You trespassed into the Tian Residence

13:02.120 --> 13:04.120
and disturbed my sister's wedding,

13:04.520 --> 13:06.520
causing a public disturbance.

13:06.750 --> 13:08.720
Even if we go to court in the future,

13:09.080 --> 13:10.600
I am the one in the right.

13:12.480 --> 13:13.320
Besides,

13:14.790 --> 13:16.190
aren't your accomplices

13:16.510 --> 13:17.870
all on Sibao Street right now,

13:17.870 --> 13:19.390
waiting to stop the bridal sedan chair?

13:19.390 --> 13:20.720
Who will care about you?

13:22.080 --> 13:23.010
What did you say?

13:24.080 --> 13:25.120
What did you say?

13:25.630 --> 13:26.360
Li Zhen.

13:26.720 --> 13:28.120
Let me tell you the truth.

13:28.440 --> 13:30.030
Today on Sibao Street,

13:30.030 --> 13:31.630
not only will they not find anything,

13:31.630 --> 13:33.240
but they will also end up bearing

13:33.240 --> 13:34.790
the charge of disrupting a wedding

13:34.790 --> 13:36.840
and be taken back
to the prefectural office for punishment.

13:36.840 --> 13:38.320
If you want to outsmart me,

13:39.200 --> 13:40.750
you still have a long way to go.

13:40.750 --> 13:42.000
Tian Benchang,

13:42.510 --> 13:43.630
you're shameless!

13:49.320 --> 13:50.180
Don't touch me.

13:51.630 --> 13:52.390
Zhen.

13:55.270 --> 13:57.240
Today is really a good day.

13:59.150 --> 14:00.960
Ronghua is getting married,

14:01.840 --> 14:03.320
and it also happens to be the last day

14:03.320 --> 14:05.650
of your Li family's half-month deadline.

14:06.510 --> 14:07.480
After today,

14:08.030 --> 14:09.470
the Li family's charge
of illicit foreign trade

14:09.470 --> 14:10.910
will be fully confirmed,

14:11.360 --> 14:13.240
and there will be no turning back.

14:17.960 --> 14:18.720
Zhen.

14:20.360 --> 14:21.390
When did your eyes

14:22.150 --> 14:24.390
become so fierce and ruthless?

14:30.840 --> 14:33.040
I remember the way
you used to look at me,

14:33.720 --> 14:36.250
your eyes always
curved like a crescent moon.

14:36.870 --> 14:37.870
It was adorable.

14:39.480 --> 14:41.210
Let me take a closer look at you.

14:41.670 --> 14:42.630
Tian Benchang!

14:51.320 --> 14:53.120
Don't touch me, Tian Benchang!

14:53.120 --> 14:54.150
Let me go!

14:54.670 --> 14:55.790
Let me go!

14:56.360 --> 14:57.120
Sit down!

15:01.120 --> 15:01.960
Zhen.

15:03.600 --> 15:05.600
Before we were supposed to get married,

15:05.600 --> 15:07.360
you always acted spoiled with me

15:07.360 --> 15:08.790
and asked me
to draw your eyebrows in the future.

15:08.790 --> 15:10.720
How about I draw them for you today?

15:17.510 --> 15:18.320
Come here.

15:29.320 --> 15:30.150
Li Zhen.

15:31.910 --> 15:33.670
I know you hate me.

15:35.390 --> 15:37.080
But what did I do wrong?

15:40.120 --> 15:41.480
I was born poor

15:41.960 --> 15:44.160
and burdened by my family's situation.

15:44.200 --> 15:47.530
So I had no choice but to risk everything
for a better future.

15:49.750 --> 15:50.960
Before,

15:52.320 --> 15:54.200
you were a part of my future.

15:56.510 --> 15:58.440
It's a pity you didn't understand.

16:00.080 --> 16:01.880
Not only did you not understand,

16:02.000 --> 16:04.000
but you also crushed my heart

16:04.030 --> 16:05.960
and got involved with Luo Wenqian.

16:09.630 --> 16:10.440
Li Zhen.

16:11.870 --> 16:12.950
From the moment you stepped
out of that sedan chair

16:12.950 --> 16:14.550
to break off the engagement,

16:14.600 --> 16:16.910
you chose the wrong path
and the wrong person.

16:16.910 --> 16:17.960
Today,

16:18.750 --> 16:20.840
you are at my mercy.

16:40.960 --> 16:42.030
Tian Benchang.

16:44.960 --> 16:47.030
You've always gone against

16:49.270 --> 16:51.200
and compared yourself to Wenqian.

16:53.390 --> 16:54.670
In the end,

16:56.030 --> 16:58.120
you just feel inferior deep down.

16:59.150 --> 17:00.840
You are jealous of his talent,

17:01.390 --> 17:03.030
his background,

17:03.030 --> 17:04.750
and his character.

17:05.069 --> 17:06.869
And what's more, you're jealous

17:07.349 --> 17:09.480
that I love him but hate you.

17:10.450 --> 17:12.380
Even if he is a prisoner now,

17:13.069 --> 17:14.440
in my heart,

17:15.680 --> 17:18.940
he is a hundred or a thousand times
more important than you!

17:19.720 --> 17:20.829
Say that again!

17:21.920 --> 17:25.450
You always say you were burdened
and forced by your background.

17:26.000 --> 17:28.000
But back then, when our whole family

17:28.069 --> 17:29.640
squeezed into a small place
in City Gate Lane,

17:29.640 --> 17:31.000
compared to your family,

17:31.000 --> 17:32.730
the situation was even harder.

17:32.750 --> 17:33.960
And Wenqian—

17:34.720 --> 17:36.070
his family was ruined.

17:36.270 --> 17:38.130
How was he any better off than you?

17:38.480 --> 17:40.000
But over the years,

17:40.270 --> 17:41.880
we've never been like you,

17:42.030 --> 17:44.030
doing whatever it takes
to achieve our goals.

17:44.030 --> 17:45.070
In truth,

17:45.510 --> 17:49.240
you are nothing but a hypocrite,
selfish to the core.

17:49.310 --> 17:50.110
You

17:51.070 --> 17:52.590
don't deserve me.

18:06.590 --> 18:07.880
I don't deserve you?

18:10.200 --> 18:12.550
I secured the tribute ink contract
for the Tian family.

18:12.550 --> 18:14.280
And  I am the manager of Tian Ink.

18:15.920 --> 18:18.550
Once I get a position
in the Directorate of Imperial Household,

18:18.550 --> 18:20.550
not to mention the Hui Ink families,

18:21.000 --> 18:23.310
even Lord Yan and Prefect He

18:23.510 --> 18:25.110
will have to show me respect.

18:26.920 --> 18:28.980
Do you think you can keep the position

18:29.640 --> 18:31.590
after trading your sister for it?

18:32.310 --> 18:33.400
Tian Benchang,

18:34.240 --> 18:36.570
the higher you climb, the harder you fall.

18:39.110 --> 18:41.880
Whether I can keep it is my own ability.

18:42.720 --> 18:44.180
It's none of your concern.

18:44.750 --> 18:47.080
You'd better worry about yourself first.

18:47.590 --> 18:48.510
How about this?

18:51.270 --> 18:52.930
I'll give you one last chance.

18:55.640 --> 18:57.030
As long as you promise me

18:57.590 --> 18:59.680
to be obedient from now on,

19:01.160 --> 19:02.200
I'll let

19:02.200 --> 19:03.730
what happened today slide.

19:04.350 --> 19:05.960
I can even find a scapegoat

19:05.960 --> 19:09.290
to take the blame
for the Li family's illicit foreign trade.

19:13.640 --> 19:15.240
Then you can be with me again.

19:16.230 --> 19:16.960
How about it?

19:22.310 --> 19:23.590
Dream on.

19:27.720 --> 19:28.440
Stop there.

19:28.880 --> 19:29.960
Don't come any closer.

19:29.960 --> 19:31.220
Don't come any closer!

19:40.790 --> 19:41.510
Right.

19:42.590 --> 19:43.550
Just like that.

19:44.200 --> 19:45.530
Over the past few years,

19:45.590 --> 19:47.390
every waking moment, I imagined

19:47.640 --> 19:49.360
making you wholly mine

19:50.000 --> 19:52.070
and bringing you completely to heel.

19:54.040 --> 19:55.200
Tian Benchang.

19:55.790 --> 19:56.960
Kill me

19:57.680 --> 19:59.070
if you dare!

20:00.070 --> 20:02.960
Having the Tian family bear another life

20:03.270 --> 20:05.110
will make my trip worthwhile.

20:06.110 --> 20:07.030
What?

20:08.030 --> 20:08.960
You don't dare?

20:09.840 --> 20:10.960
Lost your nerve?

20:14.160 --> 20:14.760
Benchang.

20:15.830 --> 20:16.430
Benchang!

20:18.260 --> 20:19.590
-Tian Benchang!
-Benchang!

20:19.590 --> 20:21.110
Calm down. Calm down.

20:23.310 --> 20:23.920
Benchang.

20:23.960 --> 20:24.640
Speak.

20:26.880 --> 20:28.740
Everything went as you expected.

20:29.070 --> 20:30.590
Ronghua's wedding sedan
was stopped as soon

20:30.590 --> 20:32.250
as it arrived at Sibao Street.

20:32.550 --> 20:34.310
Those rebels

20:34.310 --> 20:38.440
have been taken to the prefectural office
by Officer Zhang to be punished.

20:38.440 --> 20:39.350
Bensheng.

20:40.350 --> 20:41.640
You handled this matter

20:41.640 --> 20:42.680
quite well.

20:44.310 --> 20:45.750
Has Ronghua's sedan left the city?

20:45.750 --> 20:46.750
In an hour,

20:46.750 --> 20:49.480
they will meet up
with the welcoming procession.

20:51.960 --> 20:52.790
Li Zhen,

20:53.270 --> 20:54.480
you heard all that?

20:55.310 --> 20:58.000
Your accomplices have all been taken away
by the authorities.

20:58.000 --> 20:59.730
Ronghua has also left the city.

21:00.160 --> 21:01.160
In the end,

21:01.790 --> 21:03.200
you can't do anything.

21:04.550 --> 21:05.160
Benchang,

21:05.180 --> 21:07.730
the obstacles have been cleared.

21:07.960 --> 21:10.310
Shouldn't we get down to business?

21:11.070 --> 21:12.400
Have someone watch her.

21:12.550 --> 21:14.280
Bring her some food and drinks.

21:14.550 --> 21:16.030
Before we come back,

21:16.070 --> 21:17.750
make sure she stays alive.

21:49.110 --> 21:50.960
Benchang, if you are not feeling well,

21:50.960 --> 21:52.890
I can deliver those things myself.

21:54.920 --> 21:56.030
Idiot.

21:56.750 --> 21:58.280
What's the use of you going?

21:58.680 --> 22:00.240
Now everyone is on edge.

22:00.640 --> 22:02.170
If I don't show up in person,

22:02.270 --> 22:04.470
how would they dare to accept the goods?

22:06.880 --> 22:07.510
Let's go.

22:27.920 --> 22:29.120
Eldest Young Master,

22:29.460 --> 22:30.680
all goods have been accounted for.

22:30.680 --> 22:32.350
According to the original plan,

22:32.350 --> 22:33.480
you guys move the ink
out of the city first.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.740
We will follow behind.

22:34.750 --> 22:36.070
Let's meet up outside the city.

22:36.070 --> 22:36.720
Yes.

22:57.880 --> 22:58.510
Benchang,

22:58.640 --> 23:00.040
isn't that Chen Junshan?

23:01.510 --> 23:02.350
If the Chen family

23:02.350 --> 23:03.240
sees this batch of ink,

23:03.240 --> 23:04.110
we are doomed.

23:04.920 --> 23:05.780
Baixi Village—

23:06.030 --> 23:07.160
It's the closest place to us.

23:07.160 --> 23:08.440
The village is full of our people.

23:08.440 --> 23:10.110
As long as we get in, we'll be safe.

23:10.110 --> 23:11.240
Go to Baixi Village!

23:27.240 --> 23:28.040
Tian Benchang

23:28.270 --> 23:30.000
is heading towards Baixi Village.

23:30.000 --> 23:31.750
Hurry and inform those of Huang Ink

23:31.750 --> 23:33.000
to block them on their way.

23:33.000 --> 23:33.520
Yes!

24:25.680 --> 24:26.880
Benchang, what do we do now?

24:26.880 --> 24:28.540
What are you panicking about?

24:29.550 --> 24:30.830
What a bunch of mob!

24:31.800 --> 24:33.550
My Tian family is an imperial merchant,

24:33.550 --> 24:35.440
the leading ink house
in Huizhou ink industry.

24:35.440 --> 24:37.070
You openly block us here.

24:37.160 --> 24:38.920
Are you forcing me to sue
at the prefectural office

24:38.920 --> 24:40.510
and have you all punished?

24:41.720 --> 24:43.720
What "leading ink house"
are you talking about?

24:43.720 --> 24:45.590
Tian Ink has repeatedly

24:45.590 --> 24:47.240
disrupted the order of the ink industry.

24:47.240 --> 24:48.100
Tian Benchang,

24:48.400 --> 24:50.240
your good days are over today!

24:50.270 --> 24:51.270
Manager Huang,

24:51.640 --> 24:53.240
why bother talking to him?

24:54.440 --> 24:55.840
Search the ink directly!

24:55.990 --> 24:57.390
I'd like to see who dares!

24:57.480 --> 24:59.480
Prefect He has arrived.

25:23.920 --> 25:24.550
Thank you.

25:26.400 --> 25:27.240
Zhen.

25:28.310 --> 25:29.030
Ronghua.

25:32.030 --> 25:33.200
What happened to you?

25:33.200 --> 25:34.680
It's nothing serious. Just a minor injury.

25:34.680 --> 25:35.210
Let's go.

25:35.880 --> 25:36.830
Tian Benchang.

25:37.440 --> 25:38.480
Tian Bensheng.

25:38.960 --> 25:40.200
You two...

25:40.640 --> 25:41.550
I am Li Zhen,

25:42.030 --> 25:43.440
paying respects to Lord He.

25:43.440 --> 25:44.440
Your Excellency.

25:49.350 --> 25:51.160
Li Zhen, you've suffered.

25:53.310 --> 25:54.110
Li Zhen?

25:55.070 --> 25:56.200
Why are you here?

26:01.750 --> 26:02.610
Tian Benchang,

26:03.350 --> 26:04.590
don't you get it yet?

26:05.550 --> 26:07.550
I deliberately fell into your trap.

26:07.640 --> 26:08.790
If not,

26:09.110 --> 26:10.960
how could you walk right into my trap

26:10.960 --> 26:13.480
and be caught with the contraband ink?

26:17.750 --> 26:19.110
Ronghua, let's go separately.

26:19.110 --> 26:20.270
I'll take the back door.

26:20.270 --> 26:21.310
You go home quickly

26:21.310 --> 26:22.970
so as not to arouse suspicion.

26:23.480 --> 26:24.270
Go quickly.

26:38.070 --> 26:38.870
Manager Zhen,

26:38.920 --> 26:41.780
is there contraband ink
in the Tian family's dowry?

26:43.510 --> 26:44.270
Mr. Xiao,

26:44.310 --> 26:45.420
sorry to trouble you.

26:45.420 --> 26:46.950
Escort Ronghua back later.

26:47.030 --> 26:48.110
Make sure to keep an eye on

26:48.110 --> 26:49.750
whether anyone is following her.

26:49.750 --> 26:51.480
Was there anything unusual?

26:52.240 --> 26:54.510
When Ronghua
was investigating the contraband ink,

26:54.510 --> 26:56.400
she was almost discovered
by Tian Benchang.

26:56.400 --> 26:58.240
I'm a little worried.

26:59.240 --> 27:00.110
Don't worry.

27:00.310 --> 27:01.720
Leave this to me.

27:01.790 --> 27:02.350
Okay.

27:11.860 --> 27:14.640
I stayed hidden and followed Tian Ronghua
all the way.

27:14.640 --> 27:15.480
Manager Zhen,

27:15.790 --> 27:17.070
just as you expected.

27:17.960 --> 27:19.270
Those two boys from the Tian family

27:19.270 --> 27:20.720
were also tailing her.

27:21.510 --> 27:23.440
I was worried about the safety
of  Ronghua,

27:23.440 --> 27:26.070
so I waited in a quiet place
outside for four hours.

27:26.070 --> 27:27.550
Seeing nothing happen,

27:27.790 --> 27:29.390
I finally dared to come back.

27:30.070 --> 27:31.200
It seems

27:32.100 --> 27:34.230
Tian Benchang already knows our plan.

27:35.550 --> 27:37.150
But that doesn't make sense.

27:37.720 --> 27:39.110
If he knew everything,

27:39.400 --> 27:41.000
why wouldn't he take action?

27:42.160 --> 27:44.030
If he wants that post
in the Directorate of Imperial Household,

27:44.030 --> 27:46.750
he must move the ink quickly
and turn it into silver.

27:46.750 --> 27:48.680
Yet he's sitting tight now.

27:48.680 --> 27:50.610
He's clearly trying to mislead us.

27:52.880 --> 27:55.210
The ink shouldn't be in the dowry anymore.

27:55.640 --> 27:57.230
Tomorrow, during the bridal escort,

27:57.230 --> 27:58.570
he will surely come up with another trick

27:58.570 --> 27:59.630
to move the ink out.

28:03.920 --> 28:04.830
Cuiqiao,

28:05.310 --> 28:06.160
Mr. Xiao,

28:06.550 --> 28:09.310
tomorrow, I still have
to follow the original plan

28:09.310 --> 28:10.640
and get into the bridal sedan for Ronghua.

28:10.640 --> 28:12.440
No, that's too risky.

28:12.740 --> 28:14.400
No matter what Tian Benchang is thinking,

28:14.400 --> 28:16.230
he must have a backup plan against you.

28:16.230 --> 28:17.640
If you go so rashly,

28:17.750 --> 28:19.270
won't you fall into his trap?

28:19.270 --> 28:20.640
But if I don't go,

28:21.000 --> 28:22.440
Tian Benchang
will be even more suspicious.

28:22.440 --> 28:24.270
Only by falling into his trap

28:24.590 --> 28:26.120
can I dispel his suspicion.

28:26.720 --> 28:27.680
Not only me,

28:28.830 --> 28:30.200
buttomorrow you and Doggie

28:30.200 --> 28:32.530
must also stop the sedan chair as planned.

28:33.240 --> 28:33.880
No.

28:34.480 --> 28:35.790
It's still too dangerous.

28:35.790 --> 28:36.880
If Master were here,

28:36.880 --> 28:37.590
he wouldn't let you risk—

28:37.590 --> 28:39.000
This is my only chance.

28:40.720 --> 28:41.680
Only by doing so

28:42.070 --> 28:43.880
will Wenqian have a chance of survival.

28:43.880 --> 28:45.030
And only then can
Ronghua

28:45.030 --> 28:46.750
and the Li family survive this.

28:46.750 --> 28:48.030
I have no other choice.

28:53.510 --> 28:54.510
Cuiqiao,

28:55.960 --> 28:57.360
I can only take this risk.

29:04.160 --> 29:05.000
Zhen.

29:05.720 --> 29:06.720
Elders,

29:07.000 --> 29:08.160
thank you for being

29:08.160 --> 29:09.400
willing to help Li Ink.

29:09.400 --> 29:11.310
Please accept my bow.

29:11.310 --> 29:12.000
This...

29:12.790 --> 29:13.550
Zhen.

29:13.880 --> 29:15.350
The Tian family is steeped in evil.

29:15.350 --> 29:16.510
With the Li family
suffering such a disaster,

29:16.510 --> 29:18.350
how could we stand idly by?

29:18.640 --> 29:19.900
Third Master is right.

29:20.160 --> 29:22.160
If the Tian family is not rooted out,

29:22.200 --> 29:24.730
it will ruin the entire
Huizhou ink industry.

29:25.200 --> 29:27.110
We can't tolerate it any longer.

29:27.640 --> 29:29.590
Zhen, Madam Wang has

29:29.590 --> 29:31.510
already told us the whole story.

29:31.590 --> 29:33.160
Just tell us

29:33.160 --> 29:34.690
whatever you're planning.

29:34.720 --> 29:35.720
Elders,

29:35.960 --> 29:37.790
tomorrow I must find a way

29:38.070 --> 29:40.670
to draw out Tian Benchang
and that batch of ink.

29:40.750 --> 29:42.550
As for Cuiqiao and my grandfather,

29:42.550 --> 29:44.240
they will surely
be watched by the Tian family,

29:44.240 --> 29:45.240
making it hard for them to act.

29:45.240 --> 29:46.880
After I enter the Tian Residence tomorrow,

29:46.880 --> 29:48.000
the rest of the matters

29:48.000 --> 29:49.260
will be left to you all.

29:49.720 --> 29:51.070
Zhen, just say it.

29:51.110 --> 29:52.960
We are all waiting for you
to make the plan

29:52.960 --> 29:54.160
and assign the tasks.

29:54.590 --> 29:55.400
First,

29:55.720 --> 29:57.030
tomorrow's wedding procession

29:57.030 --> 29:58.510
must be closely followed

29:58.590 --> 30:00.200
to protect Ronghua's safety.

30:00.200 --> 30:01.000
Secondly,

30:01.070 --> 30:02.200
send someone to inform Prefect He

30:02.200 --> 30:03.480
in advance.

30:03.590 --> 30:06.190
Make sure he catches
them red-handed himself.

30:06.240 --> 30:07.200
Third Grandfather.

30:07.200 --> 30:08.000
President Hu.

30:08.030 --> 30:09.030
I'm afraid

30:09.030 --> 30:10.270
only you two can step forward for this.

30:10.270 --> 30:11.270
Rest assured.

30:11.480 --> 30:12.540
Don't worry, Zhen.

30:12.960 --> 30:15.690
We represent
the Huizhou Literary Association.

30:15.790 --> 30:16.790
If we go in person,

30:17.160 --> 30:19.000
Prefect He should grant us an audience.

30:19.000 --> 30:19.720
Third,

30:19.880 --> 30:21.140
and most importantly,

30:21.160 --> 30:23.240
tomorrow,
when Tian Benchang lets his guard down

30:23.240 --> 30:24.350
and goes out to deliver the ink,

30:24.350 --> 30:26.160
someone must closely follow him.

30:26.160 --> 30:28.480
We must catch him red-handed.

30:34.000 --> 30:36.400
I'm counting on you all.

30:38.790 --> 30:39.590
It's me.

30:42.830 --> 30:44.830
Zhen, I was worried about you.

30:44.960 --> 30:46.160
Ronghua, listen to me.

30:46.160 --> 30:47.720
Tian Benchang has known our plan.

30:47.720 --> 30:48.310
What?

30:48.310 --> 30:49.270
But don't worry.

30:49.270 --> 30:50.830
Everything will go as originally planned.

30:50.830 --> 30:51.640
Rest assured,

30:51.640 --> 30:53.240
I've already arranged for someone
to protect you in secret.

30:53.240 --> 30:54.300
So don't be afraid.

30:55.690 --> 30:57.510
Keep this courtyard under strict watch.

30:57.510 --> 30:59.110
Don't let anyone in or out as they please.

30:59.110 --> 31:00.830
Go behind the screen! Hurry, this way.

31:00.830 --> 31:01.510
Remember.

31:01.550 --> 31:03.080
Stick to the original plan.

31:08.590 --> 31:09.400
Your Excellency.

31:09.400 --> 31:11.070
It's absolutely true.

31:11.070 --> 31:13.990
I am willing to guarantee it
with the century-old reputation

31:13.990 --> 31:15.640
of the Huizhou Literary Association.

31:15.640 --> 31:17.840
Your Excellency, please come in person

31:18.440 --> 31:21.240
and bring the Tian family
to justice in one stroke.

31:21.920 --> 31:22.920
Your Excellency.

31:23.110 --> 31:24.880
I just received word

31:24.880 --> 31:26.110
while on patrol.

31:26.720 --> 31:29.920
But I had the box opened
and inspected on the spot.

31:30.920 --> 31:32.400
There was no contraband ink inside.

31:32.400 --> 31:35.550
That's because Tian Benchang
changed the ink transportation route.

31:35.550 --> 31:36.550
Your Excellency.

31:36.790 --> 31:38.350
If the Literary Association
is not enough,

31:38.350 --> 31:40.240
I am willing to stake the Chen Ink name

31:40.240 --> 31:41.880
and my own life as guarantee.

31:41.880 --> 31:43.590
Please dispatch troops!

31:46.550 --> 31:47.400
Guards!

31:48.310 --> 31:48.960
Your Excellency.

31:48.960 --> 31:50.920
Assemble the constables.

31:50.950 --> 31:52.550
Follow me to catch the criminals
with the loot.

31:52.550 --> 31:55.480
And send a few men to the Tian family
to rescue Li Zhen.

31:55.750 --> 31:57.010
Yes, Your Excellency.

31:57.160 --> 31:57.500
Your Excellency.

31:57.500 --> 31:58.300
Manager Zhen!

31:58.310 --> 31:59.200
Manager Zhen!

32:00.240 --> 32:01.110
Manager Zhen!

32:01.110 --> 32:02.000
What are you doing?

32:02.000 --> 32:02.510
We are looking for Manager Zhen.

32:02.510 --> 32:03.110
Get out of the way!

32:03.110 --> 32:03.790
Search!

32:05.440 --> 32:06.400
Manager Zhen!

32:06.830 --> 32:07.790
Manager Zhen!

32:16.920 --> 32:17.920
Your Excellency.

32:18.000 --> 32:19.030
I, Li Zhen,

32:19.030 --> 32:20.720
formally accuse the Tian family
of illicit foreign trade
through ink.

32:20.720 --> 32:22.620
Under the guise
of marrying off his sister,

32:22.620 --> 32:23.770
the Manager of the Tian Family,

32:23.770 --> 32:26.000
Tian Benchang, concealed
contraband ink among the dowry chests

32:26.000 --> 32:27.830
and later moved it here.

32:27.880 --> 32:30.350
Please investigate thoroughly,
Your Excellency!

32:30.350 --> 32:31.350
Your Excellency,

32:31.640 --> 32:33.440
I saw with my own eyes

32:33.680 --> 32:35.550
that nearly a thousand sticks

32:35.550 --> 32:36.680
of Ziji Dragon Light Ink

32:36.680 --> 32:39.550
specially made for illicit foreign trade
were hidden in my dowry.

32:39.550 --> 32:40.830
Today, in order

32:40.960 --> 32:42.640
to transport the ink, Tian Benchang

32:42.640 --> 32:44.240
imprisoned innocent Li Zhen

32:44.310 --> 32:45.680
and forced me to marry.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.750
Please investigate thoroughly,
Your Excellency!

32:47.750 --> 32:48.680
Your Excellency,

32:48.680 --> 32:50.680
I, Chen Junshan, can also testify.

32:51.270 --> 32:53.800
Moments ago,
Tian Benchang and Tian Bensheng

32:53.880 --> 32:55.350
tried to flee
with this cart of contraband ink.

32:55.350 --> 32:56.310
Having failed,

32:57.000 --> 32:59.160
they were cornered here by us.

32:59.480 --> 33:02.340
Please investigate thoroughly,
Your Excellency!

33:03.590 --> 33:04.550
Guards,

33:05.510 --> 33:06.570
search for the ink.

33:20.160 --> 33:21.690
Found it, Your Excellency.

33:33.000 --> 33:35.400
It really is contraband ink.

33:36.240 --> 33:37.110
Arrest them!

33:40.510 --> 33:41.510
Your Excellency,

33:42.440 --> 33:43.830
the crimes committed by the Tian family

33:43.830 --> 33:45.360
are not limited to this one.

33:45.880 --> 33:46.810
Three years ago,

33:47.100 --> 33:49.070
to seize the Luo family's property,

33:49.070 --> 33:50.680
Tian Huai'an and Tian Benchang

33:50.680 --> 33:52.590
colluded with County Magistrate Zhao She

33:52.590 --> 33:53.640
and mercilessly

33:53.640 --> 33:55.840
burned the entire Luo household alive.

33:56.000 --> 33:57.750
The ink recipe
for this Ziji Dragon Light Ink

33:57.750 --> 33:59.200
was stolen
from the Luo family's Young Master,

33:59.200 --> 34:00.400
Luo Wensong.

34:00.790 --> 34:01.750
Besides this,

34:01.920 --> 34:03.110
since the Tian family
entered the ink industry,

34:03.110 --> 34:04.400
they have been committing evil deeds,

34:04.400 --> 34:06.710
repeatedly sabotaging other families.

34:06.970 --> 34:08.040
My Li family alone

34:08.070 --> 34:10.110
has suffered repeated schemes
at the Tian family's hands—

34:10.110 --> 34:10.989
forced requisition of pine timber,

34:10.989 --> 34:14.030
false accusations of illicit trade,
and other schemes.

34:14.030 --> 34:16.830
Your Excellency, I also have a grievance
to voice.

34:16.960 --> 34:18.510
When the mines were in chaos,

34:18.510 --> 34:20.440
the Tian family recklessly annexed
ink workshops

34:20.440 --> 34:21.760
and forced my father to his death.

34:21.760 --> 34:23.360
They treat human lives as trifles,

34:23.360 --> 34:24.510
utterly devoid of conscience.

34:24.510 --> 34:26.150
Heaven itself would not
tolerate such evil.

34:26.150 --> 34:28.350
Please investigate, Your Excellency.

34:30.000 --> 34:30.920
Your Excellency,

34:30.920 --> 34:33.360
I am willing to present evidence
of my own crimes.

34:33.360 --> 34:35.070
During the previous Tribute Ink selection,

34:35.070 --> 34:36.760
Sage Qing He's appraisal

34:36.880 --> 34:38.030
was gravely unjust.

34:39.030 --> 34:41.150
I hope Your Excellency
will report to the imperial court,

34:41.150 --> 34:43.150
strip the Tian family of its status
as Tribute Ink supplier,

34:43.150 --> 34:45.440
and return justice to the Chen Family.

34:52.150 --> 34:53.150
Your Excellency.

34:54.480 --> 34:57.280
Everything the ink industry members
said is true.

34:57.400 --> 34:58.880
The Tian family
has committed numerous crimes.

34:58.880 --> 35:02.000
Please uphold justice
for the Huizhou ink industry.

35:02.710 --> 35:03.510
President Hu.

35:03.960 --> 35:05.110
Your Excellency,

35:05.190 --> 35:08.050
please uphold justice
for Huizhou's ink industry!

35:11.400 --> 35:12.710
Everyone, quickly.

35:13.030 --> 35:13.960
Please rise.

35:13.980 --> 35:14.980
Please rise.

35:15.960 --> 35:16.880
Please rise.

35:21.400 --> 35:22.930
Regarding today's matter,

35:23.150 --> 35:23.880
I

35:24.550 --> 35:27.410
shall judge this matter
with strict impartiality!

35:29.230 --> 35:30.320
Tian Benchang,

35:31.150 --> 35:33.360
confess immediately!

35:33.960 --> 35:35.800
Your Excellency, please understand.

35:35.800 --> 35:37.190
I came across some documents

35:37.190 --> 35:38.070
relating to illicit foreign trade

35:38.070 --> 35:39.670
at home today by chance.

35:40.320 --> 35:43.000
That's when I learned my second brother,
Tian Bensheng, was so audacious

35:43.000 --> 35:45.960
as to conduct illicit foreign trade
through ink behind my back!

35:45.960 --> 35:47.290
My brother was foolish,

35:47.510 --> 35:49.000
and I was deeply grieved.

35:49.000 --> 35:50.760
So I rushed here to stop him,

35:50.800 --> 35:53.400
preventing him
from making further mistakes.

35:54.230 --> 35:55.230
Your Excellency.

35:56.230 --> 35:56.880
Benchang.

35:57.070 --> 35:58.280
What kind of strategy is this?

35:58.280 --> 35:59.320
What should I say?

35:59.320 --> 36:01.030
Stop being stubborn!

36:02.360 --> 36:03.360
Your Excellency.

36:03.630 --> 36:04.880
Since he's handing
over the contraband ink,

36:04.880 --> 36:05.880
he must have a deed with him

36:05.880 --> 36:07.670
as proof of the transaction.

36:08.110 --> 36:08.920
If you don't believe me,

36:08.920 --> 36:10.030
just search him.

36:10.030 --> 36:11.440
Benchang, what do you mean?

36:11.440 --> 36:12.190
Bensheng!

36:12.280 --> 36:12.890
Okay.

36:13.880 --> 36:14.550
Search him!

36:18.280 --> 36:20.340
Your Excellency, it's not like that.

36:38.590 --> 36:39.230
This...

36:53.040 --> 36:57.590
[Huizhou Prefecture Office]

36:53.360 --> 36:54.320
Second Master.

36:54.590 --> 36:57.280
Second Master,
please say something for me.

36:57.760 --> 36:58.510
Wu Xin.

36:58.880 --> 37:00.480
The Tian family is conducting
illicit foreign trade,

37:00.480 --> 37:02.080
and were caught red-handed.

37:02.110 --> 37:03.960
Aren't you going to tell the truth?

37:03.960 --> 37:05.110
Who exactly

37:05.320 --> 37:07.630
ordered you to frame the Li family?

37:07.630 --> 37:08.320
I'll talk.

37:08.880 --> 37:10.590
I will confess everything truthfully.

37:10.590 --> 37:11.320
It was him.

37:12.100 --> 37:14.030
He gave me ten taels of silver,

37:14.230 --> 37:16.160
held my wife and children hostage,

37:16.280 --> 37:19.480
and forced me to give false testimony
to frame the Li family.

37:19.480 --> 37:20.480
Your Excellency.

37:20.760 --> 37:23.760
I didn't dare to disobey, Your Excellency!

37:23.880 --> 37:25.480
These were all Benchang's orders.

37:25.480 --> 37:27.110
Tian Benchang gave the orders!

37:27.110 --> 37:27.550
I just...

37:27.550 --> 37:28.550
Your Excellency!

37:29.960 --> 37:30.710
Your Excellency.

37:30.710 --> 37:32.800
Since the Tian family
won the tribute ink contract,

37:32.800 --> 37:35.060
I have been focusing on the ink workshop.

37:35.320 --> 37:37.360
After learning that Benchang
was conducting illicit foreign trade,

37:37.360 --> 37:39.070
I knew I had failed in my oversight

37:39.070 --> 37:40.600
and was extremely ashamed.

37:40.710 --> 37:42.070
I failed the young lady of the Li family

37:42.070 --> 37:43.110
and Li Ink.

37:43.670 --> 37:44.670
Up to today,

37:45.230 --> 37:47.150
he has committed such a terrible disaster.

37:47.150 --> 37:48.510
No matter
how Your Excellency punishes him,

37:48.510 --> 37:50.480
I will have no complaints!

37:50.880 --> 37:51.880
Your Excellency.

37:52.030 --> 37:53.400
All of Tian Benchang's excuses

37:53.400 --> 37:54.630
are just shirking responsibility.

37:54.630 --> 37:56.360
Today, he fled with the ink,

37:56.360 --> 37:57.760
and everyone saw it.

37:57.840 --> 38:00.880
Besides, the people who transported ink
for the Tian family are right here.

38:00.880 --> 38:03.070
Your Excellency,
you will know once you ask!

38:03.070 --> 38:03.670
Move.

38:05.800 --> 38:06.800
Your Excellency.

38:07.000 --> 38:08.880
As per your orders,

38:08.880 --> 38:10.760
we searched along the route

38:10.760 --> 38:12.440
taken by Tian Benchang and Tian Bensheng.

38:12.440 --> 38:14.110
At Baling Pavilion in the suburbs,

38:14.110 --> 38:16.230
we found these three
were behaving suspiciously.

38:16.230 --> 38:16.880
Upon investigation,

38:16.880 --> 38:19.960
these three are the accomplices
receiving the contraband ink.

38:19.960 --> 38:22.070
The three of you, confess at once.

38:22.230 --> 38:24.840
Who was the one colluding with you
to traffic ink

38:24.840 --> 38:26.640
through illicit foreign trade?

38:33.280 --> 38:35.230
The one who contacted us
was Tian Bensheng.

38:35.230 --> 38:36.670
Nonsense!

38:36.920 --> 38:38.070
You're talking nonsense!

38:38.070 --> 38:39.000
He's talking nonsense!

38:39.000 --> 38:39.840
How dare you!

38:40.670 --> 38:42.150
You dare lie

38:42.190 --> 38:42.960
before Lord He?

38:42.960 --> 38:44.420
Your Excellency heard it.

38:44.440 --> 38:45.480
He has already testified

38:45.480 --> 38:47.670
that this matter has nothing
to do with me.

38:47.670 --> 38:48.920
Just now, Li Zhen

38:49.230 --> 38:50.670
said I fled with the ink.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.800
I must clarify this matter.

38:53.800 --> 38:55.840
After I discovered Bensheng
was conducting illicit foreign trade,

38:55.840 --> 38:57.570
I immediately went to stop him.

38:57.710 --> 38:58.510
But he...

38:58.920 --> 39:01.030
But he intended to flee.

39:01.630 --> 39:02.630
I had no choice

39:02.630 --> 39:04.150
but to chase him all the way.

39:04.150 --> 39:06.030
This led to a misunderstanding

39:06.030 --> 39:07.960
among the ink merchants, Your Excellency.

39:07.960 --> 39:09.150
Tian Benchang!

39:09.550 --> 39:11.150
Are you even human?

39:11.150 --> 39:12.230
You are lying!

39:12.360 --> 39:13.440
Tian Benchang,

39:13.670 --> 39:15.590
you are clearly the mastermind
behind the illicit foreign trade!

39:15.590 --> 39:16.800
Bensheng!

39:17.510 --> 39:20.550
Those documents
all bear your seal and signature.

39:20.800 --> 39:22.800
How long will you keep denying it?

39:23.400 --> 39:25.400
You forced my hand to stamp them!

39:25.400 --> 39:25.920
You forced...

39:25.920 --> 39:26.920
Bensheng!

39:29.190 --> 39:31.050
Having reached this point today,

39:31.280 --> 39:33.840
you should come to your senses, Bensheng.

39:34.750 --> 39:37.280
Don't say I'm the mastermind, Benchang.

39:37.280 --> 39:38.670
Don't say it was me.

39:38.670 --> 39:40.030
I beg you.

39:40.030 --> 39:42.440
-Why did you say I was the mastermind?
-Your Excellency!

39:42.440 --> 39:44.360
Tian Bensheng is dull and incompetent.

39:44.360 --> 39:46.280
Everyone in Huizhou knows this.

39:47.000 --> 39:48.510
No one would believe
that he could have concealed

39:48.510 --> 39:49.400
his involvement

39:49.400 --> 39:51.230
in illicit foreign trade
from the entire Tian family.

39:51.230 --> 39:52.000
Besides,

39:52.070 --> 39:53.550
all affairs of the Tian family

39:53.550 --> 39:55.670
are entirely
under Tian Benchang's control.

39:55.670 --> 39:57.230
If the illicit foreign trade

39:57.230 --> 39:59.030
was done by Tian Bensheng alone,

39:59.150 --> 40:01.280
how could Tian Benchang,
the manager of the Tian family,

40:01.280 --> 40:03.000
remain unaware of it?

40:03.150 --> 40:04.070
Your Excellency,

40:04.070 --> 40:05.280
I can also testify.

40:05.760 --> 40:08.110
Bensheng always
follows Benchang's lead.

40:08.110 --> 40:09.000
Regarding the illicit foreign trade,

40:09.000 --> 40:10.480
even if Bensheng handled it,

40:10.480 --> 40:11.280
the mastermind behind it

40:11.280 --> 40:13.000
must be Tian Benchang.

40:13.190 --> 40:14.590
You useless thing!

40:14.960 --> 40:16.150
Do you want all the Tian family to die

40:16.150 --> 40:17.000
before you are satisfied?

40:17.000 --> 40:17.800
Father!

40:18.070 --> 40:20.230
The mastermind of this matter
is clearly Benchang.

40:20.230 --> 40:21.110
At this point,

40:21.110 --> 40:22.780
why are you still covering for him?

40:22.780 --> 40:25.190
I'll beat you to death,
you selfish and unfilial daughter!

40:25.190 --> 40:26.190
Tian Huai'an,

40:26.230 --> 40:27.480
you need to think clearly

40:27.480 --> 40:29.760
about exactly who dragged your Tian family

40:29.760 --> 40:31.590
into this situation.

40:31.840 --> 40:34.100
Are you really going
to stand by and watch

40:34.280 --> 40:35.710
your second son

40:36.110 --> 40:38.150
die in place of your eldest?

40:38.710 --> 40:40.320
Father. Father.

40:40.480 --> 40:41.710
Say something for me.

40:41.710 --> 40:43.370
Say something for me, Father.

40:43.510 --> 40:45.920
Benchang forced me
to do all of it.

40:45.920 --> 40:48.030
You know it, Father.

40:49.960 --> 40:50.800
Tian Huai'an,

40:51.110 --> 40:52.960
regarding the Tian family's
illicit foreign trade,

40:52.960 --> 40:54.590
did you know about it or not?

41:01.190 --> 41:02.880
For the illicit foreign trade,

41:02.880 --> 41:04.150
Bensheng was the one
who showed his face

41:04.150 --> 41:06.480
for the documents, hiring, and delivery.

41:06.630 --> 41:07.360
Father.

41:07.710 --> 41:08.840
The lifeblood of our Tian family

41:08.840 --> 41:10.640
rests entirely on my shoulders.

41:11.880 --> 41:14.190
If it really comes to a last resort,

41:14.480 --> 41:16.680
we can only use Bensheng as a scapegoat.

41:16.760 --> 41:20.090
That's the only way the Tian family
can survive this crisis.

41:22.190 --> 41:22.920
Father.

41:24.630 --> 41:26.070
Day and night,

41:26.760 --> 41:28.820
I devoted myself to the ink workshop.

41:29.960 --> 41:32.280
Every ledger I handled

41:33.230 --> 41:34.550
is completely clean.

41:34.550 --> 41:35.230
Father,

41:35.500 --> 41:37.390
you have seen them yourself.

41:37.960 --> 41:40.440
How could I have conducted
illicit foreign trade, Father?

41:40.440 --> 41:41.440
Your Excellency,

41:41.670 --> 41:43.960
I truly know nothing
about the illicit foreign trade,

41:43.960 --> 41:47.510
nor did I know my second son, Bensheng,

41:48.400 --> 41:50.130
was carrying that batch of ink.

41:56.550 --> 41:57.280
Bensheng,

41:58.030 --> 41:59.630
just tell them the truth.

42:00.280 --> 42:02.540
His Excellency will take into account
that this is your first offense

42:02.540 --> 42:03.840
and a moment of foolishness,

42:03.840 --> 42:05.400
and may show leniency.

42:09.030 --> 42:10.230
Father!

42:10.670 --> 42:13.440
I am your son, too, Father!

42:14.030 --> 42:15.800
Are you giving up on me?

42:16.000 --> 42:16.840
Master.

42:17.360 --> 42:19.000
Bensheng is our son, too.

42:19.000 --> 42:20.400
You can't do this, Master.

42:20.400 --> 42:21.000
Shut up!

42:21.000 --> 42:22.150
You can't do this!

42:22.150 --> 42:23.150
Your Excellency,

42:23.280 --> 42:24.840
can't you see it yet?

42:25.000 --> 42:26.630
It's obvious that Tian Huai'an

42:26.630 --> 42:28.480
has conspired with Tian Benchang

42:28.480 --> 42:30.480
to make Tian Bensheng take the fall!

42:30.590 --> 42:32.070
Please investigate thoroughly,
Your Excellency!

42:32.070 --> 42:32.960
Your Excellency,

42:32.960 --> 42:35.420
if you still have doubts
about my innocence,

42:35.710 --> 42:37.000
you can immediately write

42:37.000 --> 42:38.730
to Nanjing Commander Wu, Wu Ru.

42:38.920 --> 42:40.510
He can stand as my guarantor.

42:40.510 --> 42:42.000
Commander Wu is a military officer,

42:42.000 --> 42:43.360
not a judge.

42:43.630 --> 42:46.160
What guarantee can he
possibly offer for you?

42:46.710 --> 42:47.630
Tian Benchang,

42:48.030 --> 42:49.070
don't forget

42:49.590 --> 42:52.670
that the Tian family's
illicit foreign trade is now a fact.

42:52.670 --> 42:56.140
Why would Commander Wu
bring trouble upon himself now?

42:56.760 --> 42:58.400
Li Zhen is right.

42:58.670 --> 43:01.530
Please investigate thoroughly,
Your Excellency!

43:01.840 --> 43:04.320
Tian family, Li family, hear the verdict!
